# Development Record

## 2026-10-02 — Project Initialisation

### Objective

Created a new project for an independently developed Roblox football toolset.

The objective is to develop custom systems for organised football matches, including match management, referee functionality, replay/review functionality, and related administrative features.

### Initial Systems Planned

- Match management
- Player management
- Ball management
- Referee tools
- Offside detection
- Replay/review
- Match event tracking
- Administrative tools
- UI

### Development Status

Project structure created.

No production release has been made.

---

## 2026-10-XX — Architecture

