### Shared Systems

- Configuration
- Types
- Utility modules

---
# Development Principles

The project is developed using original implementation work.

Where functionality is similar to existing football league systems, the implementation should be created independently rather than copied from third-party source code unless appropriate permission or licensing exists.

Third-party materials must be recorded in:

```text
docs/THIRD_PARTY.md
```

